      <p class="viz-note">The matrix stores total counts, nothing else. It doesn't know that "tree" was important in 1995 and irrelevant in 2025. Both facts sit in the same row, diluting each other. Understanding would require the ability to revise, to reweight, to learn. A static table can't do any of those.</p>
